| !Run for !GLibTest - riscos-gtk M1: GLib 2.80 on RISC OS
| A UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF): it needs SharedUnixLibrary
| and ARMEABISupport (PackMan). g_convert uses the Iconv module (PackMan),
| which UnixLib loads itself when it is in System:Modules.
Set GLibTest$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error GLibTest needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error GLibTest needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| The thread tests use the PThreadTicker module (0.03, shipped here).
| 0.01 on purpose: see its ReadMe (an older copy in use can't be replaced).
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <GLibTest$Dir>.PThrTicker
| Prints TAP lines and a summary, then ends: the task window stays open.
| The same output is saved in <GLibTest$Dir>.Result (overwritten each run).
TaskWindow "<GLibTest$Dir>.Run2" -wimpslot 8192K -name "GLibTest" -display
